PASS  the factorisation is exact   | max |QTQᵀ - W| = 3.54e-08
PASS  T is upper quasi-triangular (only the 2x2 subdiagonal survives)   | max below the first subdiagonal = 0.00e+00
PASS  and the spectrum is preserved (a similarity transform)
